397
00:24:00,740 --> 00:24:07,260
The meer sight of his injured friend hastens the Colonel's
determination to uncover the forces plaguing the military.

398
00:24:07,720 --> 00:24:10,900
While the young man is forced to
put everything he has on the line

399
00:24:10,960 --> 00:24:13,340
In order to escape from a dead end.

400
